# Novelty dot

When you add or change a documented page, mark it new in the latest changelog release so the sidebar shows the dot.

In `src/lib/changelog.ts`, on the current release, set `new: true` on the item whose `href` is that page. `isNewDocsPage` reads those flags. The dot is the `bg-new` mark in `DocsContents`.

If the page is already in that release, add `new: true` to the existing item. Do not add a second indicator.

```ts
{
  kind: "changed",
  text: "What changed, in one sentence.",
  href: "/docs/components/badge",
  new: true,
}
```
